      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enders%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was first platted in 1890 as \"Old Enders\" near the Frenchman River, then moved two miles west in 1908 to sit on the new railroad line.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
